xt-decoration:underline" href="#i6158aa6c50ce4621a4d9a2405abbc9c1_7">Table of Contents</a></span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">CREATIVE MEDIA &amp; COMMUNITY TRUST CORPORATION AND SUBSIDIARIES</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements as</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">of December 31, 2025 and 2024</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">and for the Years Ended December 31, 2025 and 2024  </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">(Continued)</span></div></div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="us-gaap:ReconciliationOfAssetsFromSegmentToConsolidatedTextBlock" id="f-1457" escape="true"><ix:continuation id="f-1368-4"><div style="margin-top:9pt;text-indent:36pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The condensed assets for each of the segments as of December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024 are as follows: </span></div><div style="margin-top:9pt"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:99.853%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:63.321%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td st